---
subject: Verify your email for <%= it.appName %>
---
<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#09090b;">Confirm your email address</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3f3f46;">Welcome to <strong><%= it.appName %></strong>.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3f3f46;">Please confirm this email address to activate your account. This link expires in <%= it.expiresInHours %> hour<%= it.expiresInHours === 1 ? '' : 's' %>.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0;"><tr><td align="center" style="border-radius:8px;background-color:#2563eb;"><a href="<%= it.url %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 26px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Verify email</a></td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#71717a;">If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this URL into your browser:<br /><a href="<%= it.url %>" style="color:#2563eb;text-decoration:none;word-break:break-all;"><%= it.url %></a></p>
<p style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#71717a;">If you didn't create an account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
===TEXT===
Welcome to <%= it.appName %>

Please confirm your email address to activate your account. This link expires
in <%= it.expiresInHours %> hour(s).

  <%= it.url %>

If you didn't create an account, you can safely ignore this email.
